category: Libs
requires: libpoke2 pkg-config
sdesc: "The extensible editor for structured for binary data (development)"
ldesc: "GNU poke is an interactive, extensible editor for binary data.  Not
limited to editing basic entities such as bits and bytes, it provides
a full-fledged procedural, interactive programming language designed
to describe data structures and to operate on them."
external-source: poke

